{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>באחו.</b> Some say: a valley in which plants grow. Some say: it is the name of a plant, the bet superfluous like the bet of השביעני in במרורים (Lamentations 3:15). On both interpretations, כי הוא בין אחים יפריא (Hosea 13:15) — it is its mother's brother."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:36.273777476Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}